  "description": "At 18, Kwon Seung-Ho—the “Legend”—reigned supreme over high schools across Seoul, reaching the pinnacle of violence. But after reaching the top, Kwon Seung-Ho vanished without a trace... Now, ten years later, defying everyone’s expectations that he would have become at least a nationwide gang boss, he has reappeared as a new employee at Samjin Corporation!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
